**Autonomous Adversarial AI Emulation & Continuous Red Teaming Platform**

Engineered by **[ZeroHack.org](https://zerohack.org)**.

## 🥷 Overview

ShadowRed (`sred`) replaces slow and expensive human-led red teaming with an autonomous multi-agent hacking swarm. Operating natively within CI/CD pipelines, ShadowRed continuously probes, maps, and executes multi-vector prompt injections, data-leak probes, and privilege escalation bypass chains against enterprise LLM applications.

## Install

```bash
pip install -e .
```

## Quickstart

```bash
# 1. Run automated adversarial penetration test
sred run

# 2. Launch live radar telemetry web dashboard (:9595)
sred web --port 9595
```

